---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-24 border-t bg-[var(--color-surface)]">
  <div class="container-page py-12 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-4">
    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="grid h-8 w-8 place-items-center rounded-md bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-bold">D</span>
        <span class="text-lg font-bold">DonReady</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        Find scrubs that fit your body, budget, and shift. Brand comparisons and sizing guidance for healthcare workers.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">Explore</h4>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        <li><a href="/scrub-fit-quiz" class="hover:text-foreground">Fit Quiz</a></li>
        <li><a href="/compare" class="hover:text-foreground">Brand Comparisons</a></li>
        <li><a href="/best-scrubs" class="hover:text-foreground">Best Scrubs</a></li>
        <li><a href="/dress-code-checker" class="hover:text-foreground">Dress Code Checker</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold">About</h4>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-foreground">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-foreground">Contact</a></li>
        <li><a href="#" class="hover:text-foreground">Privacy</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t">
    <div class="container-page py-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground">
      <p class="max-w-2xl">
        DonReady provides shopping guidance only. Always confirm your employer's uniform policy before purchasing. Brand names referenced for comparison purposes only.
      </p>
      <p>© {year} DonReady.xyz</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
